<?php
// RASTATIME 2026-11-13 - Widgets -> Song Request.  Same shape as the other
// widget pages (status instead of a label form, preview, embed code); the
// pool is picked under Settings -> General.
// RASTATIME 2026-11-14 - own listener texts (form below the status): an
// empty field keeps the standard text, the placeholder shows it in the
